SUMMARY:Shucked
DESCRIPTION:The Tony Award-winning musical comedy Shucked makes its IU Au
 ditorium debut in 2027.  &#160\;  Maizy and Beau are getting hitched\, wh
 en the corn that protects their small community starts to die. The town n
 eeds answers. But who will dare venture beyond the borders of Cob County?
   &#160\;  Including the knockout songs "Woman of the World\," "Somebody 
 Will\," and "Independently Owned\," this Broadway hit about an unlikely h
 ero\, an unscrupulous con artist\, and a battle for the heart and soil of
  a small town\, is not to be missed.
