SUMMARY:Jazz at Lincoln Center Presents World on a String: Swinging Songs
  of Broadway
DESCRIPTION:Marking the fifth production in the Jazz at Lincoln Center PR
 ESENTS series\, guest vocalists Kate Kortum and David Marino will debut a
 rrangements of tunes from Broadway's most beloved productions including H
 amilton\, Wicked\, South Pacific\, West Side Story\, and more in a specia
 l concert event entitled World on a String: Swinging Songs of Broadway.  
 &#160\;  For over three decades\, Jazz at Lincoln Center has been a leadi
 ng advocate for jazz\, culture\, and arts education globally. Under the d
 irection of Wynton Marsalis\, Jazz at Lincoln Center has brought the art 
 form of jazz from the heart of New York City to over 446 cities in more t
 han 40 countries.
